    "detailed_description": "Welcome to GameLab UngAalborg's game launcher!<br />\r\nYou will be able to try out all of our available games and prototypes made by people from the physical space of GameLab.<br />\r\nYou'll be able to try games about removing plastic from the sea and upgrading your raft in &quot;plastic planet&quot; or killing zombies in &quot;ZombVasion&quot;. You'll also be able to play the different versions of &quot;Slap City&quot; or shoot your way through the complex in the game &quot;Rampage inc&quot;. The genres varies from top down controller games, to 2D sidescrollers - You'll probably find something to your liking!",
